## Three.js

`src/components/WebGLBackground.tsx` renders a single full-screen shader plane
with [three.js](https://threejs.org) (MIT License). To keep the app bundle small
and the bundler fast, three.js is **not** bundled into the app. The prebuilt ESM
build is generated once and served as a static asset:

```
npm run vendor:three   # public/vendor/three/three.module.js
```

The app marks `three` as external and resolves it to that asset (see
`vite.config.ts` and the import map in `index.html`).

